---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The second look at technical change." description="SECOND / PASS is a technical intelligence publication built around a simple editorial idea:">
  <section class="shell route">
    <header class="route-head">
      <div class="kicker">/ ABOUT</div>
      <h1>The second look at technical change.</h1>
    </header>
    <div style="max-width:var(--reading);font:1.18rem/1.65 var(--reader)">
      <p>SECOND / PASS is a technical intelligence publication built around a simple editorial idea:
the first pass tells you what happened; the second pass tells you what it means.</p>
<p>The publication focuses on AI systems, compute, semiconductors, systems infrastructure, security,
research, and source-backed technical data.</p>
<p>AI may assist discovery, research organization, verification support, drafting, and editing.
It does not remove editorial accountability and is not permission to fabricate reporting, people,
sources, quotations, tests, or results.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
